{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marble Mechanics</strong> is an immersive VR sandbox, simulation, and puzzle experience where players design and craft intricate marble runs. With intuitive controls and realistic physics, it empowers imagination and creativity. Whether you're a builder who thrives on innovation or a spectator who enjoys the calming flow of marbles gliding through complex tracks, the game's soothing soundscapes and tranquil environment provide a engaging yet relaxing escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Tutorials &amp; Puzzles</strong>: Learn core mechanics and challenge your engineering brain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Sandbox Mode</strong>: Edit, duplicate, group, save, load, and delete custom track setups with intuitive tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Undo/Redo</strong>: Tinker freely without fear\u2014every mistake is reversible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-Alignment Toggle</strong>: Enable precision placement or go freeform; the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Gravity Settings</strong>: Recreate Earth-like realism or invent bizarre new physics playgrounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Tooltips</strong>: Find the right features when you need them, without breaking creative flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soothing Soundscapes</strong>: Immerse yourself in a meditative atmosphere while you build and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop Integration:\u00a0</strong>Share, download, remix, collaborate, Marble Mechanics is a community-powered experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dual Rollers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap